WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,400
That expansion blueprint can be exchanged for a lot of supplies.

2
00:00:02,680 --> 00:00:04,640
The usage conditions of that drawing are too high

3
00:00:05,080 --> 00:00:06,400
No one would buy it even if it was put up.

4
00:00:06,800 --> 00:00:07,800
Even so

5
00:00:08,320 --> 00:00:09,760
We also gave two more gold coins

6
00:00:09,760 --> 00:00:10,800
Japanese weapons and iron chopsticks

7
00:00:10,800 --> 00:00:12,200
Already very good

8
00:00:12,560 --> 00:00:14,840
This man's eyesight is too small and he lacks the ability to plan.

9
00:00:15,160 --> 00:00:16,280
The other party can rely on himself within a day

10
00:00:16,280 --> 00:00:17,240
Upgraded to three-door position

11
00:00:17,360 --> 00:00:18,320
Extremely strong

12
00:00:18,480 --> 00:00:19,520
And true to his word

13
00:00:20,000 --> 00:00:21,320
Have a good relationship with this kind of person

14
00:00:21,760 --> 00:00:23,560
It’s just that maybe we can save our lives tomorrow

15
00:00:23,920 --> 00:00:25,320
I only have this one gold coin left

16
00:00:25,800 --> 00:00:27,360
Do you need a dozen more silver coins?

17
00:00:27,860 --> 00:00:29,460
If you need any more resources, let me know.

18
00:00:30,240 --> 00:00:31,280
I'll try my best

19
00:00:31,950 --> 00:00:33,150
Do you want to kill Xiaomei?

20
00:00:33,430 --> 00:00:35,310
I can make louder noises

21
00:00:35,510 --> 00:00:36,590
Then you take the opportunity to open the door

22
00:00:36,590 --> 00:00:37,950
Attack the little girl with talent

23
00:00:38,070 --> 00:00:40,950
The reward for breaking the news is that you deceived me three times.

24
00:00:41,390 --> 00:00:42,630
Let me think about it for a moment

25
00:00:42,630 --> 00:00:44,590
Anyway, I will never go out and take risks.

26
00:00:44,990 --> 00:00:46,590
There is extra income from blood transfer

27
00:00:47,150 --> 00:00:48,990
If not, just lie down and develop.
